[h1][b]Sudden update of TitTok Girls and TitTok Girls Easy + discounts! Happy Halloween to you![/b][/h1]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41417020/0fc093a72122b1390a79a3e14ee918791d0f14a7.png[/img]
[h3][b]■ TitTok Girls[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ The game has been ported to the new, latest version of the engine;
▪ Updated all technical aspects of the game:
▪ This will allow us to keep our finger on the pulse in the future and respond more quickly to challenges.
▪ Updated leaderboards, added a general leaderboard;
▪ Fixed a rare crash in puzzles that occurred when performing a certain sequence of actions;
▪ Fixed a bug that allowed you to pass puzzles in an unfair way, using the flaws of the pause;
▪ Fixing the operation of the gamepad in level 14;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.[/b]
[h3][b]■ Discounts for the whole week up to 90%! Hurry up to buy the game at a bargain price:[/b][/h3]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1805270




[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41417020/e940277be9641ce9dad3eacc772be6f59ca9fc75.png[/img]
[h3][b]■ TitTok Girls Easy[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ The game has been ported to the new, latest version of the engine;
▪ Updated all technical aspects of the game:
▪ This will allow us to keep our finger on the pulse in the future and respond more quickly to challenges.
▪ Updated leaderboards, added a general leaderboard;
▪ Fixed a rare crash in puzzles that occurred when performing a certain sequence of actions;
▪ Fixed a bug that allowed you to pass puzzles in an unfair way, using the flaws of the pause;
▪ Correction of the sound of pointing at the back button in pause;
