[h3][b]■ Take it absolutely for free:[/b][/h3]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822830

[h1][b]Big Double Update Game and DLC![/b][/h1]

[h3][b]TitTok Girls:[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ A lot of work has been done on the game engine;
▪ Updating developer certificates;
▪ Redesigned title screen, improved interactivity;
▪ Added information about the next game in the series: TitTok Pussy
▪ Added a second ending, after passing the SOK PRO SEX addon;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.[/b]

[h3][b]TitTok Girls Easy [/b][/h3]
[b]▪ A lot of work has been done on the game engine;
▪ Updating developer certificates;
▪ Redesigned title screen, improved interactivity;
▪ Added information about the next game in the series: TitTok Pussy
▪ Added a second ending, after passing the SOK PRO SEX addon;
▪ Improved support for gamepads;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.[/b]

[h3][b]Many other minor changes and fixes:[/b][/h3]
[b]▪ In order not to overload the news, I will not describe minor technical and imperceptible changes to the eye. But a lot of work has been done these days. Many thanks to all those who report bugs and problems! Thank you, dear players, thanks to you the game is getting better![/b]

[h1][b]Try our new game:[/b][/h1]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/2010320/TitTok_Pussy/

[h3][b]Write about bugs and errors on the forum, I will fix everything: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1805270/discussions/0/3157580476248140497/]Bugs and other problems[/url][/b][/h3]
[h3][b]A live support chat with the developer is also available: [url=https://s.team/chat/Y5SG9zpR]TitTok Live Support[/url][/b][/h3]

[h1][b]Meet the Big Cumulative Update for the game and for the DLC![/b][/h1]

[h2][b]The work boils, the game is updated and supplemented!
DLC also keeps up and gets its dose of updates =)[/b][/h2]

[h2][b]Main Game:[/b][/h2]
[b]▪ The design of the main menu has been improved and brought to a unified style;
▪ Kittens on the gallery logo in the main menu in the "Kittens" mode ^^
▪ Japanese language support has been added (a lot of work has been done!)
▪ Tips for Japanese have been added;
▪ Localization of new design elements in all languages;
▪ Removed languages of regions where the game is unavailable or has no customers;
▪ Other changes and fixes;
▪ Engine optimization.[/b]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1805270/TitTok_Girls



[h2][b]DLC:[/b][/h2]
[b]▪ The addendum has been finally transferred to the new design;
▪ The ending is now completely done in a new, green design;
▪ The name of the supplement is now visible in the final credits, so you can brag to your friends on screenshots;
▪ The Secret Achievement in the credits works correctly;
▪ The Easterling in level 7 has now been added to the add-on! Now there's no need to turn off the DLC to get the achiever for the passchalk. Everything is now easy! Like the add-on, easy =)
▪ Pussycat mode support has been improved (no erotica mode). Now there are pussies everywhere in this mode! 
▪ Japanese language support has been added (great work done!);
▪ Removed languages of regions where the game is not available or has no customers;
▪ Completely redesigned leaderboard display mode. Millisecond values are now correctly and beautifully displayed in thousandths (01:04:666) of seconds! In words it is easy and simple, but a lot of work has been done on it.
▪ Other changes and fixes;
▪ Engine optimization;
▪ A reminder that the add-on is absolutely free![/b]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822830/TitTok_Girls_Easy



[h2][b]What's next?[/b][/h2]
[b]Report all problems on the forum. Also send all your tips, recommendations and thoughts on the same forum. I will take everything into account in the next updates of the game.[/b]
[b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1805270/discussions]https://steamcommunity.com/app/1805270/discussions[/url][/b]

[h1][b]Hello, everyone![/b][/h1]

[h2][b]Some players found the puzzle format of the game "15 Puzzle" very difficult.[/b][/h2]
[b]That's why I developed a separate game mode! This is a simplified mode for those who don't want to or can't play Sprinkles.
It took a global reworking of the engine, and adapting all 32 puzzles to the new gameplay mechanics. This add-on was made in emergency mode, almost without sleep, so if you come across any minor bugs - they will be fixed instantly! Report all problems on the forum.[/b]

[h2][b]What you get in the new mode:[/b][/h2]
[b]▪ Control with the mouse;
▪ Puzzles themselves are magnetized to their area, when dragged;
▪ You can play with one hand;
▪ Levels are completed in seconds;
▪ Absolutely free![/b]

[h2][b]How do I get this add-on? Just install this DLC:[/b][/h2]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1822830/TitTok_Girls_Easy/




[h1][b]Also, the main game has been updated:[/b][/h1]
[b]▪ The interface has been globally redesigned;
▪ There is information about the new, free easy game mode;
▪ The gallery has become more visual and convenient;
▪ Support of declared languages has been improved;
▪ The main menu has been redesigned and made more convenient.
▪ Other small changes and corrections. Hundreds of them.[/b]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1805270/TitTok_Girls/




[h2][b]What's next?[/b][/h2]
[b]I will continue to provide technical and content support for the game. I will bring everything to perfection, as always.
So report all the problems on the forum. Also send all your tips, recommendations and thoughts on the same forum. I'll keep everything in mind for the next updates to the game.[/b]
[b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1805270/discussions]https://steamcommunity.com/app/1805270/discussions[/url][/b]
